WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Luffy has just found the once piece and&nbsp;
the final war that will determine the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:10.020
fate of the world is about to begin. The world&nbsp;
government is on the brink of collapse. And in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:14.100
a last ditch effort to get rid of Luffy,&nbsp;
*they are willing to bet every last piece&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.840
of gold they have* to issue the highest&nbsp;
bounties the world has ever seen. But,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:22.560
how crazy will the straw hats final bounties&nbsp;
at the end of the story actually be?

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.020
Starting with the crew’s doctor, Chopper.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:30.000
It’s a reoccurring joke is the series that&nbsp;
Chopper always has a laughably low bounty. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.320
marines have always thought that that Chopper,&nbsp;
being a reindeer, is just the Straw Hats’ pet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:40.200
First he had a bounty of 50 berries. It then&nbsp;
doubled to 100. And then it multiplied by ten&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.840
all the way to the incredible sum of…1,000&nbsp;
berries. However, surely by the end of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:50.975
series someone in the government will catch on&nbsp;
to this reindeer’s genius level intellect. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.975 --> 00:00:51.075
it’s totally possible that we won’t even get any&nbsp;
more bounties. After all, the World Government&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.075 --> 00:00:51.169
might not even exist at the end of the story.&nbsp;
However, in this scenario, let’s just imagine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.169 --> 00:00:52.260
what they could be if the Straw Hats really do&nbsp;
accomplish their dreams and claim the One Piece.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:57.240
This amazing doctor has the dream of&nbsp;
curing every disease - and while this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.240 --> 00:01:02.160
is a very positive thing for the world,&nbsp;
it’s also indispensable for the Straw&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:11.400
Hat crew. Chopper poses a huge risk to the&nbsp;
government because he can heal any injury or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.740
disease that the dangerous Straw Hat pirates&nbsp;
face. And you see, Eiichiro Oda, the author&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:19.800
of One Piece, absolutely loves to use wordplay&nbsp;
with the numbers he uses in his series. Chopper’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:25.380
devil fruit, the Hito Hito no Mi or Human Human&nbsp;
fruit can actually be read as “Hi-To” like the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:30.000
japanese word for the number one ‘hitotsu’ -&nbsp;
Therefore it only makes sense that Chopper’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:36.240
final bounty would include “HiTo” in honor of his&nbsp;
devil fruit! That’s why I’m going to multiply his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:41.160
current bounty by 1000! That will bring him&nbsp;
to 1,000,000 berries but for good measure&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:49.140
I’m going to throw on an extra 100,000. That&nbsp;
bring’s Chopper’s bounty to 1,100,000 berries.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:53.880
Someday, when the Straw Hats finally reach the One&nbsp;
Piece, they’ll only make it there due to Nami’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:58.980
navigation skills. As the Straw Hats’ navigator,&nbsp;
they literally couldn’t get anywhere without&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:03.780
her. The only reason they’re able to brave the&nbsp;
perilous seas of the One Piece world is through&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:10.200
her expert understanding of the weather.Therefore&nbsp;
hugely increasing her current bounty makes sense&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:15.600
due to the danger she presents to the World&nbsp;
Government. As a fighter,&nbsp; Nami is one of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:20.220
weakest members of the Straw Hat crew and has&nbsp;
a hard time holding her own against the members&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:24.300
of Yonkou crews. However, after recruiting&nbsp;
Big Mom’s Cloud Homie, Zeus, to her side,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:29.700
she’s become a more threatening combatant. It&nbsp;
might seem extreme to bring Nami of all people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:35.280
above 1,000,000,000 berries, but we have to&nbsp;
remember - these are the bounties of the Pirate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:42.000
King’s crew - and possibly the last bounties&nbsp;
that the government will ever put out.Also,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:45.660
of course, I expect that her bounty&nbsp;
poster will follow the same pattern as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:51.000
it has previously. Each time an undercover Marine&nbsp;
photographer will ask for her to pose for photos,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:57.120
which she’s always more than willing to model&nbsp;
for. Somehow she hasn’t caught on that these&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:02.520
photographers aren’t in it for her good looks, but&nbsp;
that she’s actually posing for the most glamorous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:11.580
bounty poster on the high seas. Nami’s bounty is&nbsp;
going to raise from 366,000,000 to 1,172,000,000.&nbsp;

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:21.360
Once he leads an army of giants. Usopp will become&nbsp;
a brave warrior of the sea. Once the Straw Hats&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:26.760
sail to Elbaf, he’ll use his connections to&nbsp;
the giants he’s met so far like Kashi, Oimo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:32.640
Dorry, and Broggy to forge an alliance and end&nbsp;
up leading a whole army of giants against the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:37.620
World Government. After feats like this, the World&nbsp;
Government will have no choice but to put a bounty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:43.800
on Usopp’s head that exceeds one billion berries.&nbsp;
And that will be comedy gold because Usopp is one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:48.600
Straw Hat that actively wants his bounty to&nbsp;
be lower. Every time he gets a higher bounty,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:54.300
he freaks out and would very much not like the&nbsp;
World Government to be after him. But despite his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:59.760
best efforts his feats, whether accidental or not,&nbsp;
keep pushing his bounty higher and higher.After&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:04.740
freeing the Dressrosa prisoners and being&nbsp;
worshipped as God Usopp, he gained a bounty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:10.920
of 200,000,000 berries. He even had the God&nbsp;
Usopp name put on his wanted poster. After Wano,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:17.340
he’s considered an important crew member of a&nbsp;
Yonkou crew and raised to 500,000,000 berries.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:21.480
It’s not out of the ordinary for a Yonkou&nbsp;
crew member to have a bounty of 1 billion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:26.640
or above. And while Usopp’s strength, at least&nbsp;
right now doesn’t justify this high of a number,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:32.340
the government won’t know how weak Usopp actually&nbsp;
is in a head to head fight. They’ll just know that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:37.020
he has an army of giants at his disposal. And&nbsp;
who knows, maybe the theory that Usopp will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:42.120
awaken conqueror’s haki, will actually turn out&nbsp;
to be true as well. So by the end of the story,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:48.780
I want Usopp to have a bounty of&nbsp;
1,100,000,000. But wow - if Usopp’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:54.960
bounty is over a billion…just imagine how&nbsp;
high Luffy’s will be by the end of the series.

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:59.760
I’m surprised that Brook’s bounty&nbsp;
poster says “Dead or Alive”...since he’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:02.820
already dead. [Brook Laugh Here]&nbsp;
But we’re not talking about that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:06.240
part of the wanted poster. We’re&nbsp;
here to talk about that bounty.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:11.820
Already in the story, Brook, the ship’s musician,&nbsp;
is one of the biggest celebrities in the One Piece&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:17.520
world. The rock star Soul King Brook is loved&nbsp;
by music fans all across the oceans. And how&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:22.680
will it make the Straw Hats look once people find&nbsp;
out their favorite rock star is a member of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:28.920
crew? People all over will have a favorable&nbsp;
view of the Straw Hats, which means Brook is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:33.180
a big threat to people’s willingness to go&nbsp;
along with the World Government’s wishes.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:39.480
In addition, Brook is a powerful fighter on the&nbsp;
Straw Hat crew and was even able to survive a solo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:43.980
battle against Big Mom. While he was obviously&nbsp;
defeated due to her overwhelming strength,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:49.980
the fact that he was even able to land a scratch&nbsp;
on one of her homies is a testament to his power.

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:55.620
One day, the World Government will likely&nbsp;
realize how strong Brook actually is. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:59.760
this isn’t even mentioning his stealth&nbsp;
abilities. If it ever becomes common&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:04.620
knowledge that Brook can use his spirit form&nbsp;
to spy on enemies without being noticed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:08.100
his danger to the government&nbsp;
will be considered even higher.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:15.300
All of these reasons come together to make&nbsp;
his final bounty 1,430,000,000. Why 430&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:20.880
million? Well because Brook’s devil fruit, the&nbsp;
yomi-yomi no mi can also be read as “Yo-Mi” or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:26.400
“4-3”. Therefore, it’s only right that&nbsp;
“43” appears in his bounty somewhere.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:32.220
Cyborg Franky, the shipwright of the Straw&nbsp;
Hats,has finally met his inventor idol: Dr.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:40.200
Vegapunk. And by the end of the story, he’ll learn&nbsp;
from Vegapunk’s technology. To be specific - there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:47.400
is a 99.9% chance we’re going to see Franky&nbsp;
pilot a giant mech against the World Government.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:51.480
And even without a giant mech, Franky is&nbsp;
one of the strongest fighters on the crew.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:55.860
Already existing Franky inventions like&nbsp;
General Franky are also powerful enough&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.860 --> 00:07:01.680
to fight SUPER strong pirates - earning him&nbsp;
his current bounty of 394,000,000. After all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:06.420
he deserves a huge bounty after he&nbsp;
motorcycled Big Mom right in the face.

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:10.860
And after all, in the same way that Nami is&nbsp;
invaluable to the crew due to her navigation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:15.360
skills, the Straw Hats wouldn’t be able to make&nbsp;
their voyage without their ship, the Thousand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:22.320
Sunny. Franky built it and is constantly repairing&nbsp;
its damage as well as giving it powerful upgrades.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:29.520
We saw how hard the World Government came down on&nbsp;
Tom, the shipwright for Roger’s ship. Imagine how&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:34.920
severely he’d been punished if he was actually&nbsp;
Roger’s crew mate. That in itself is worthy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:42.600
of a huge bounty. So by the end of the story,&nbsp;
he’ll have a bounty of 1,832,000,000 berries.

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:49.080
Jinbe, the Knight of the Sea, the former captain&nbsp;
of the Sun Pirates, and a former Shichibukai. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:55.320
despite all of his former titles, Jinbe is now&nbsp;
first and foremost the helmsman of the Straw Hat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.320 --> 00:08:00.240
Pirates. The World Government needs to be prepared&nbsp;
to defend themselves at sea because in the final&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:05.640
war they’ll have to deal with legions of fishmen&nbsp;
and sea kings being led by Jinbe. After Wano,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:11.580
Jinbe already has a billion berry bounty. Since&nbsp;
he’s already over a billion, there’s only one way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:16.980
to go: up. He is undoubtedly one of the fiercest&nbsp;
fighters on the Straw Hat crew. As a fishman,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:21.840
he’s unstoppable in the ocean, with the&nbsp;
ability to take out entire ships with one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:27.180
attack from his fishman karate. He’s also a&nbsp;
great leader and strategist who can step in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:31.860
when Luffy is otherwise occupied. After all,&nbsp;
he was already the leader of another famous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:39.660
and powerful pirate crew. His desire for fishman&nbsp;
liberation stands opposed to the World Government,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:43.980
making him a huge threat to their established&nbsp;
order. And so as one of the strongest crew&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:48.360
members and one of the most respected&nbsp;
individuals across the One Piece world,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:53.460
Jinbe will receive a bounty of&nbsp;
2,500,000,000 by the end of the story.

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:58.740
Robin isn’t as powerful as Jinbe, but&nbsp;
she poses the biggest threat to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:03.660
World Government out of all the crew with&nbsp;
the possible exception of Luffy. Once she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:07.680
uncovers the true history of the world one of&nbsp;
the only people who can read the poneglyphs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:13.260
the government will be even more desperate&nbsp;
to capture her. After all, revealing this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:18.780
truth to the world will probably cause a&nbsp;
worldwide revolution. If knowledge is power,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:23.760
Robin is one of the most powerful characters&nbsp;
in One Piece. She’s also the Straw Hats’ direct&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:26.580
connection to the Revolutionary Army, having spent&nbsp;
the time skip with them. She’s directly worked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:32.160
with Monkey D. Dragon and Sabo, probably being&nbsp;
even closer to them than Luffy is even though&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:36.660
Luffy is Dragon’s actual son. It’s certain that&nbsp;
when it’s time to topple the World Government,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:41.760
Robin will be one person who’s leading the&nbsp;
charge. After all, the revolutionaries were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:47.580
inspired to form after the destruction of&nbsp;
Ohara, of which Robin is the last survivor.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:52.980
While with the revolutionaries, she also received&nbsp;
plenty of combat training. Even though she’s not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:56.760
as strong as the premiere fighters of the&nbsp;
crew, she can definitely hold her own,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.760 --> 00:10:00.780
having defeated Black Maria, one of&nbsp;
Kaidou’s Flying Six. The government&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:05.100
knows exactly how much of a threat Robin&nbsp;
actually is, having tried to capture&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:11.580
her all of her life - that’s why the Devil&nbsp;
Child will earn a 2,870,000,000 berry bounty.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:17.340
Sanji is one of the wings of the pirate king. He’s&nbsp;
one of the Straw Hat crew’s strongest members,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:22.260
able to fight toe-to-toe literally with Yonkou&nbsp;
commanders like Kaidou’s third in command,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:26.700
Queen. After Wano, he’s unlocked power&nbsp;
ups from his latent Germa powers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:32.400
activated by his raid suit that have made him&nbsp;
an even more powerful combatant. While other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:37.620
crew members excel in fighting directly, in the&nbsp;
final war Sanji is sure to use his other skill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:44.340
set. Sanji is a master of strategy and stealth&nbsp;
and certainly we’ll see Mr. Prince again by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:49.260
end of One Piece. Mr. Prince is the secret&nbsp;
identity that Sanji uses for spycraft - and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:54.180
using his intellect he was able to foil the&nbsp;
plans of cunning characters like Crocodile.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:58.200
He’s already used these skills against the&nbsp;
World Government when he allowed the crew&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:03.000
to escape Enies Lobby by opening the gates of&nbsp;
justice, and we’re sure to see them again.Sanji,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:08.280
like Robin, spells trouble for the World&nbsp;
Government. As a prince of the Germa Kingdom,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:12.840
he’s the only character we’ve ever seen&nbsp;
with an Only Alive bounty poster. As a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:17.340
member of one of the 40 kingdoms that form&nbsp;
the World Government, he poses a huge threat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:22.320
and after the events of Whole Cake Island will&nbsp;
likely be able to rally all of the forces of Germa&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:28.500
66 against the government in the final war. His&nbsp;
current bounty is over a billion, but I predict&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:34.920
that by the end of the story, he’ll achieve a&nbsp;
bounty of 3,000,000,000 berries - equivalent to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:40.260
Luffy’s current bounty. The “san” in “Sanji”&nbsp;
is the Japanese word for “three” after all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:44.820
so it only makes sense that it would be included&nbsp;
in his final bounty. If Sanji will catch up to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:51.780
Luffy’s already huge bounty, though - what does&nbsp;
that say about how ridiculous Luffy’s will become?

00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:56.820
By the time of the final war, Zoro won’t just&nbsp;
be the right hand man of the pirate king - he’ll&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.820 --> 00:12:02.340
be the world’s greatest swordsman and one&nbsp;
of the strongest characters in the verse.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:08.220
After he finally defeats Dracule Mihawk, there&nbsp;
will be no question of Zoro’s immense power.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:11.640
By the end, Zoro’s sure to upgrade his swords to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:16.920
have at least one supreme grade blade. In&nbsp;
addition, since he has conqueror’s haki,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:21.420
he’s almost certain to infuse his&nbsp;
swords with haki to create black blades.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:27.960
For this reason, the Marines will issue&nbsp;
a bounty of at least 3,000,000,001. Yes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:33.420
This number is a single berry above Sanji’s&nbsp;
bounty. And nothing would make Sanji more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:37.860
furious than having his final bounty be&nbsp;
lower than Zoro’s - even if it’s only by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:46.080
one. This would be a top tier joke from Oda&nbsp;
, and we don’t think he’s one to pass up such&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:52.080
a comedic moment. Zoro and Sanji have always&nbsp;
been at each other’s throats, but all in all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:58.260
Zoro deserves the higher bounty even if just&nbsp;
by a little bit. He’s been with Luffy from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:02.460
start of the adventure and has been willing&nbsp;
to sacrifice everything for his captain.

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:10.740
Luffy will follow in his father’s&nbsp;
footsteps and become the most wanted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:15.600
man in the world. He’ll also take after&nbsp;
the former pirate king, Gol D. Roger,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:19.740
and earn the highest bounty the&nbsp;
World Government has ever issued.

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:25.500
Why? He’s the man who attacked Enies&nbsp;
Lobby. He’s the man who coordinated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:29.820
the largest prison break in Impel Down’s&nbsp;
history. He joined Whitebeard’s assault on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:34.140
Marineford. He’s an Emperor of the Sea,&nbsp;
having taken down Kaidou. And he’s the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:39.720
inheritor of the Nika fruit - the next&nbsp;
Joyboy - and the Warrior of Liberation.

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:46.015
When Luffy brings the dawn of the world, he&nbsp;
will very likely risk toppling the world’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:52.500
powers - destroying Mariejois and ending the&nbsp;
Celestial Dragons’ rule. For all of this and more,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:57.600
we’re tempted to give him the highest&nbsp;
bounty ever at just above Roger. Roger’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:03.600
bounty was 5.5 billion, so Luffy’s could&nbsp;
suitably be 5.6 billion berries. After all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:10.800
56 is often associated Luffy because it works&nbsp;
with Japanese wordplay for “Go-Mu” or “5-6.”

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:15.900
However, we all know that Luffy doesn’t have&nbsp;
the Gomu Gomu no Mi. There’s no such fruit.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:22.680
Like Chopper, he has a model of the Hito Hito no&nbsp;
Mi - the Human Human Fruit Model Nika. And like&nbsp;&nbsp;

